Coverage: Actual diff inspected; related inverse/reland duplicate hunks checked as a chain.
Full three-file diff. Two modern C string literals replaced by cstr::cstr! for then-supported Rust version; other hunks rustfmt. Reviewer reported local build fixed. This teaches compiler floor checks, not a permanent c-string syntax ban.

